     <p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;">
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">今年</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9月10日是我国的第40个教师节，绍兴一中教育集团开展系列庆祝活动，向辛苦耕耘在一线的教师们致以崇高的敬意和节日的祝福。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>清晨走访教师办公室 领导班子集体送祝福</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">节日当天早上7:30，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市教育局副局长、绍兴一中党委书记丁初效</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">带领学校班子团队，走进每间教师办公室，向老师们送上节日问候，与老师们深入交流，感谢大家为学校教育事业的辛勤付出。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>表彰先进鼓舞干劲 全校节日庆祝大会</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下午，学校在图书馆报告厅举行庆祝教师节暨教师表彰大会，全体教职工出席会议，欢度佳节。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委副书记、校长蒋明向全体一中人送上节日祝福，并向老师们提出两点要求：一是要学高为师，身正为范；二是要启智润心，立德树人。他希望全体一中人积极践行教育家精神，为我校各项事业高质量发展作出新贡献。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">会上介绍了我校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在市直、全市学科素养</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">基本功比武</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">取得优异成绩的具体</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">情况</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并宣读了成绩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">优秀</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">名单</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并为他们颁奖。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">丁初效</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向全体一中人致以节日的问候，阐明了在第40个教师节当天举行庆祝活动的意义，他希望通过对优秀教师的表彰激励每一位教育工作者，在未来一起成就学生，成就一中，也成就自己。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">除学校层面活动外，团委也组织学生开展了一系列教师节感恩活动，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">引导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生在感恩教育中健康成长。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“求真四十载 金秋念师恩”教师节主题班会</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各班精心组织了教师节主题班会活动，引导学生学习经典尊师故事，讲述自己成长历程中老师的关怀，通过书信、贺卡等形式书写</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我和老师在一中</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的故事，表达对老师的感激之情，为老师送去教师节的祝福。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>漆光师影 扇艺留痕”教师节非遗漆扇制作</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生现场制</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“非遗”漆扇</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并将手工作品送给老师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。让学生在体验手工制作乐趣的同时，为老师送去</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">节日</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的祝福，进一步营造尊师重教氛围，培养尊师、爱师的情感和美德。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“浓浓师生情</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>拳拳桃李意”</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>祝福</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>打卡活动</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学们来到教师节祝福留言墙，把祝福话语、思念之意、感激之情留在祝福墙上。在一张张光影定格的瞬间，记录师生间浓浓的情意。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">光阴流转，授业之恩难忘；</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">尺素寸心，师生情谊弥深</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">祝愿全体一中人育人常乐！</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; margin: 0px 0px 0.001pt; text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621185154.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621185154.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621188669.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621188669.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621137305.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621137305.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621145675.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621145675.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621151749.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621151749.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621168931.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621168931.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621161412.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621161412.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621174303.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621174303.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/9/202409121621185500.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202409121621185500.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Upload